<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:medium; text-align:start"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="display:inline !important"><span style="float:none">Cher (e) Client (e),</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:medium"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial">Nous vous remercions d’avoir contacté le service clients RTFS.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:medium"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial">Nous prenons en charge votre demande et nous nous efforçons de revenir à vous le plus rapidement possible.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:medium"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial">Un numéro de requête a été attribué à votre demande il s’agit du :&nbsp;{{{Case.CaseNumber}}}<b>&nbsp;: </b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>{{{Case.Subject}}}<br />
<span style="font-size:medium"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial">Ce numéro de requête permet le suivi de votre demande, nous vous remercions par avance de le rappeler dans tous les mails relatifs à celle – ci.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:medium"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial">En cas d’urgence, nous restons disponibles par téléphone au 04 81 93 79 42.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:medium"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial">Veuillez noter que nos heures d'ouverture sont de 8h30 à 12h30 et de 13h30 à 17h30 du lundi au vendredi.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
